2026-10-31T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2419) 'The start command and Godot priority
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2419  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2419) '`start "" ...` goes in a `.cmd` file: passed inline, the empty title arrives as `\"\"` and `start` tries to run `\`. Godot raises its own process to above-normal priority, so a desk run lowers it by PID once started.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2419  1 LINE
 Text:Written

